//
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Common table names referenced by expressions
//
// Tables are user-defined idDeclTable assets, but sinTable and cosTable are
// referenced directly by the rotate stage modifier and are always present
// in base data.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
sinTable
cosTable